          "items": [
            "Why Guests Love Staying at The Java House-<br><br>✨ Sleeps 10 comfortably – 5 spacious bedrooms<br>🚋 Free Trolley to the Beach & Seacrest<br>🚲 4 Adult Bikes and 1 child (16 inch) included<br>🎶 Walk to Peddlers Pavilion – Just steps away in Seacrest, enjoy live music, family-friendly events, dining, and shopping all season long.<br>🐾 Pet-Friendly (fee applies)<br>👶 Pack n Play and High Chair Included<br>🌊 Short walk to beach access<br>🏖️ Beach gear included — chairs, umbrellas, beach towels and a cooler<br>🏊 Access to the 12,000 sq. ft. lagoon-style community pool<br>🌅 Private rooftop deck with sunset views & lounge seating<br>🔥 Large propane grill for family cookouts<br>🚿 Outdoor shower for easy beach clean-up<br>🪑 Covered front porch with charming rocking chairs<br>👑 Two King suites for ultimate comfort<br>🧺 Laundry area with front-load washer & dryer<br>📍 Prime location just off Scenic 30A<br>🏢 Professionally managed by 30A Five Star Properties with 24/7 support<br><br>Located along beautiful Scenic Highway 30A, Seacrest Beach is one of the most sought-after communities on 30A. Known for its relaxed coastal charm, pastel beach homes, and walkable layout, Seacrest offers the perfect blend of convenience and serenity.<br><br>Guests enjoy:<br>🏊 One of the largest lagoon-style pools on 30A<br>🚶 Easy beach access<br>🚲 Scenic bike paths connecting you to nearby communities<br>🍽️ Close proximity to boutique shopping and local dining<br><br>It’s the ideal setting for families who want everything within reach — without the crowds.<br><br>SLEEPING ARRANGEMENTS <br><br>FIRST FLOOR: <br>-Half bathroom off Kitchen<br><br>SECOND FLOOR: <br>- Primary Bedroom: King Bed, Private Bathroom with Shower and Tub<br>- Guest Bedroom: King Bed, Private Bathroom with Shower/Tub Combo <br><br>THIRD FLOOR:<br>- Guest Bedroom: Queen Bed with shared bathroom with Shower <br>- Guest Bedroom: Queen Bed with shared bathroom with Shower <br>- Twin bunk bed with shared bathroom with Shower",
